<title>SOUTH KOREA: Dongbu Corp shrs to be delisted on merger.</title>
<headline>Dongbu Corp shrs to be delisted on merger.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Dongbu Corp will be delisted on Friday when the the trading company is scheduled to be absorbed by its sister firm Dongbu Engineering and Construction Co, the Korea Stock Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dongbu Corp has 3.35 million shares listed on the stock market, an exchange statement said.</p>
<p>After the absorption, construction firm Dongbu Engineering will list 2.04 million new shares, the statement added.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
